A 94-byte crafted solid RAR5 archive with two entries:

  seed.bin: 128 KiB dictionary; decompresses to the single byte 0x41.
  leak.bin: 256 KiB dictionary; one match of length 4 at distance
            131073, which reads from the part of the window that was
            added when the dictionary grew from 128 KiB to 256 KiB.

The grown part of the window has never been written, so leak.bin
must decompress to four zero bytes and never to stale heap contents.

